    "description": "Platform-level cloud infrastructure provider for AppPress Cloud. Provisions DigitalOcean VPS instances, manages DNS records, bootstraps AppPress via cloud-init with Let's Encrypt SSL, and remotely installs App Packs/plugins via machine-token API. Listens to marketplace InstanceProvisioned/Terminated/Suspended/Resumed events. Not for campus or tenant-site blueprints \u2014 operator infrastructure only.",
